/// M08 CORE-038 "http server: roots green, seven assert roots".
/// Source: tests/integration/server_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledServer (L17-177).
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/http/server.can (read at
/// L46, staged as src/main.can at L50); every count pin below grounds an
/// assert arm in that fixture (health 1, table 1, settings 1, bounds 1,
/// boot 1, serve 1, main 1; total 7).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with a passed report carrying
/// exactly 7 roots, grounded per function in the server.can fixture,
/// with supplied-completion and real-can evidence present.
/// The live lifecycle, generated functions and build identity live in
/// core-038-server-semantics.can; the production process shape lives in
/// core-038-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); lifecycle variants
/// (boot fixed loopback port, GET /health, stop/wait, serve(0)) live in
/// the server-semantics file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. CAN_TSC gates the optional strict
/// tsc leg (pinned conditional in the run-shape file). Logical gates
/// SUITE/WORK/PROC and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23/QHTTP; no live
/// run now. Descriptor timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx (L24).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case http/server-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, supplied-evidence, real-evidence,
/// health-roots, table-roots, settings-roots, bounds-roots, boot-roots,
/// serve-roots, main-roots.
/// Facet map (server_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L70-73: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test fatals);
/// report-passed pins the report leg (L75: passed true); root-count pins
/// the seven roots (L75: len assertions is 7); fixture-name grounds the
/// pins in the staged fixture (L46: server.can; L50: src/main.can);
/// supplied-evidence pins supplied completion evidence (L78:
/// supplied-completion; fixture when-samples boot L51 and serve
/// L68/L72/L76); real-evidence pins real native evidence (L78: real-can;
/// fixture asserts execute real bodies: health L9, table L14, settings
/// L25, bounds L32); health-roots pins health (fixture L9: sample => ok,
/// 1 root); table-roots pins table (fixture L14: sample => ok, 1);
/// settings-roots pins settings (fixture L25: sample => ok true, 1);
/// bounds-roots pins bounds (fixture L32: sample => ok true, 1);
/// boot-roots pins boot (fixture L42: sample 0 => ok, 1); serve-roots
/// pins serve (fixture L59: sample 0 => ok, 1); main-roots pins main
/// (fixture L84: sample [] => ok, 1).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
record context
